  "text": "## PART 4: Common Branch Transactions  \n### Cash Deposit  \n**Process:**\n1. Verify customer account\n2. Count cash in front of customer\n3. Verify count matches their receipt\n4. Update account in system\n5. Provide receipt\n6. Close transaction  \n**Acceptable Cash:** Notes and coins in any condition\n**Suspicious Activity:** >£1,000 in cash (file CTR, see compliance)  \n---",
